    <div class="activity-header">
        <span class="activity-label">Tinker</span>
        <span class="activity-time">~10 min</span>
    </div>


    <div class="checklist">
        <h3>Checkpoint — before moving on, you must be able to:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Explain asymmetric gravity as a multiplier on the body's own value, and apply it on the physics clock</li>
            <li>Say where the "normal" gravity number lives, and why multiplying it beats storing a second copy</li>
            <li>Build coyote time and the jump buffer from the timestamp pattern in <a href="3.3.html">3.3</a>, and say which way the comparison turned</li>
            <li>Explain "spending" a window, and why a window read backwards cannot close itself the way a cooldown does</li>
            <li>Defend all four knobs as intent-forgiveness rather than difficulty-lowering</li>
            <li>Commit and push</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

